<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks via 11 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks via 11 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 11 foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Monday showed a net buying stance of 8.2 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors' sell orders totalled 27.10 million shares while buy orders amounted to 35.3 million shares.</p>
</text>
